Let $G$ represent German and $F$ represent French. First find the union and the overlap.

$|G\cup F|=40-6=34$.

$\begin{aligned}|G\cup F|&=|G|+|F|-|G\cap F|\\34&=24+19-|G\cap F|\\34&=43-|G\cap F|\\|G\cap F|&=9\end{aligned}$

(a) German only:

$\begin{aligned}|G\cap F'|&=|G|-|G\cap F|\\&=24-9\\&=15\end{aligned}$

(b) French only:

$\begin{aligned}|G'\cap F|&=|F|-|G\cap F|\\&=19-9\\&=10\end{aligned}$

